  "stem": "A solid cube has the same volume as a rectangular prism with edges of length \\(2\\), \\(4\\), and \\(8\\). What is the surface area of the cube?",
  "figure": null,
  "answer_type": "spr",
  "choices": null,
  "answer": null,
  "spr_answers": [
    "96"
  ],
  "solution": [
    "Volume of the prism: \\(2 \\cdot 4 \\cdot 8 = 64\\).",
    "The cube has volume \\(64\\), so its edge is \\(\\sqrt[3]{64} = 4\\).",
    "Surface area \\(= 6 \\cdot 4^{2} = 96\\)."
  ],
  "explanation": null,
  "traps": null,
